@startuml
!include business_symbols.iuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #315E57
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #7A9892
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor transparent
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #173F39
skinparam ActorBorderColor #315E57
skinparam ActorFontColor #173F39
skinparam EntityBorderColor #315E57
skinparam EntityFontColor #173F39
hide footbox

participant "<$business_actor>\n顾客" as Customer
participant "<$business_worker>\n门店员工" as Clerk
participant "<$business_entity>\nExcel 工作簿" as Excel
participant "<$business_entity>\n纸质租赁合同" as Paper
participant "<$business_actor>\n第三方支付服务" as Pay

Customer -> Clerk : 说明租赁需求(租期、身体参数、技能、偏好)
activate Clerk
Clerk -> Excel : 查询顾客和库存(顾客、租期、装备类别)
activate Excel
Excel --> Clerk : 返回可能滞后的顾客与库存记录
deactivate Excel

Clerk -> Clerk : 人工核对位置、维修状态并判断适配()
Clerk -> Clerk : 人工计算租金和可能产生的调整费用()
Clerk -> Customer : 说明装备方案、价格和归还规则()
activate Customer
Customer --> Clerk : 返回方案确认
deactivate Customer
Clerk -> Paper : 填写租赁合同(顾客、装备、租期、金额)
activate Paper
Paper --> Clerk : 返回纸质合同
deactivate Paper
Clerk -> Pay : 收取租赁费用(合同号、金额)
activate Pay
Pay --> Clerk : 返回支付结果
deactivate Pay
Clerk -> Customer : 交付装备和纸质合同()
activate Customer
Customer --> Clerk : 返回领取确认
deactivate Customer
deactivate Clerk

@enduml
